  "item_form": "proof_outline",
  "difficulty": "hit",
  "question": "$ 是否存在区间[0,1]上的连续函数 $f(x)$ ，使得 $f(x^{2})=x-f(x)$ .",
  "answer": "满足题设条件的函数不存在。",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "函数复合",
    "函数方程"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 若能由所给条件得到 $f(x)$ 的表达式，问题就解决了."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "若存在，显然 $f(0) = 0$ ， $f(1) = 1 / 2$ ，且有"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "\\begin{array}{r l} f (x) & = x - f \\left(x ^ {2}\\right) = x - x ^ {2} + f \\left(x ^ {4}\\right) = \\dots \\\\ & = x - x ^ {2} + x ^ {4} - x ^ {8} + \\dots + (- 1) ^ {n} x ^ {2 ^ {n}} + (- 1) ^ {n + 1} f \\left(x ^ {2 ^ {n + 1}}\\right). \\end{array}"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "$\\forall x \\in (0,1)$ ，由于 $\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} f(x^{2^{n+1}}) = f(0) = 0$ ，得到"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "f (x) = x - x ^ {2} + x ^ {4} - x ^ {8} + \\dots + (- 1) ^ {n} x ^ {2 ^ {n}} + \\dots , 0 \\leqslant x <   1."
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "即有"
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "text": "f (x) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} \\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} (- 1) ^ {n} x ^ {2 ^ {n}}, & 0 \\leqslant x <   1, \\\\ 1 / 2, & x = 1. \\end{array} \\right."
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "满足题设条件的函数不存在。",
    "techniques_used": [
      "函数复合",
      "函数方程"
    ]
  },
